          <h3 class="post-title">Ohao Engine</h3>
          <p class="post-stack">C++20 · Vulkan 1.3 KHR RT · GLSL · DLSS-RR · ReSTIR GI · OIDN</p>
          <p>
            Solo hybrid Vulkan renderer: deferred G-buffer and KHR path tracing share one scene, materials, bindless textures, and TLAS. Architecture spans <em>render</em>, <em>physics</em> (GJK/EPA + BVH), and a <em>gpu / Vulkan</em> layer — no engine SDK host.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>Real-time path tracing:</strong> interactive 1-spp chain with NVIDIA DLSS 4 Ray Reconstruction (raw NGX Vulkan on Linux) and vendor-neutral SVGF; ReSTIR GI on outdoor HDRI; OIDN offline + NRD compose. Golden regression: Cornell box + MetalRoughSpheres.
          </p>
